Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.08,0:00:04.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了  选张卡  好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, Pick a card. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.08,0:00:07.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在  记住花色号码\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right. Now memorize it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.00,0:00:09.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了没  好了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You got it? Oh, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.38,0:00:12.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  是这张吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay. Is that your card?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.18,0:00:17.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就是这张\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yes. Ha, ha.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.47,0:00:22.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  大家好  嗨\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, guys. Hi there.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.98,0:00:27.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们猜怎么着  班要上电视拍广告了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Guess what. Ben is gonna be in a TV commercial.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.73,0:00:30.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们在说什么  还没有定案\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What are you talking about? Well, it's not for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.82,0:00:34.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不过  我们在公园里遇到一个人  他觉得班很可爱\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But, uh, we met this guy in the park who thought Ben was really cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.99,0:00:36.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当然  这也是事实啦\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know, which he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.78,0:00:41.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以那个人留了张名片  要我带班去参加广告试镜\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Um, anyhoo, he gave us his card and told us to bring him down for this commercial he's auditioning.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.96,0:00:46.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这个人是本地最大的选角导演\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Whoa.The guy's like the biggest commercial casting director in town.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.38,0:00:50.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,班去公园随便散个步  就有试镜自动送上门\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ben takes one lousy walk in the park and gets an audition?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.76,0:00:55.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是说  班  真有你的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I mean, way to go, Ben!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.22,0:01:02.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那个公园我都去烂了  却从来没人主动找我去试镜\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Man, I've been in that park a million times. No one's ever offered me an audition.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.39,0:01:04.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道  真的很神奇  我们只是在陪班玩荡秋千\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I know, it's crazy. We were just pushing Ben on the swings...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.14,0:01:07.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我每次都玩荡秋千啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm always on the swings.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.73,0:01:10.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是哪里做错了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What am I doing wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.44,0:01:12.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就是荡秋千那里\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.40,0:01:16.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,老友记  第五季  第18集  瑞秋开始吸烟\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Friends  S05E18  The One Where Rachel Smokes
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.75,0:01:28.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主演: 珍妮佛·安妮斯顿
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.29,0:01:31.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主演: 寇妮·考克斯
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.09,0:01:35.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主演: 丽莎·库卓
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.51,0:01:44.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主演: 麦特·勒布兰
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.31,0:01:48.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主演: 马修·派瑞
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.19,0:01:51.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主演: 大卫·修蒙
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.12,0:02:07.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  我要出门了  祝我好运  祝好运\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, gotta go. Wish me luck. Good luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.21,0:02:10.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瑞秋  既然你在罗夫罗兰工作   能不能带几件马球衫回来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, Rach, now that you working at Ralph Lauren, can you bring me back some of those polo shirts?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.54,0:02:15.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么啊  第一天上班就偷公司东西  我可能下不了手喔\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Uh, well, you know what? I don't know if I'd feel comfortable stealing on my very first day.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.59,0:02:18.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不愿意慷公司之慨\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Unwilling to steal from work.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.97,0:02:20.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有意思了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.72,0:02:23.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当然  就算有人能拿免费的  那也非我莫属\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Besides, if anybody is gonna get free stuff, it's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.39,0:02:24.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了  各位  祝我好运吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, guys, way to wish me luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.89,0:02:27.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,祝你好运  给他们好看\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Good luck! Go get 'em!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.64,0:02:30.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了  来讨论帮瑞秋庆生的事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, let's discuss Rachel's birthday.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.85,0:02:33.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我建议在这周末搞个惊喜派对\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I say we throw a surprise party this weekend.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.36,0:02:35.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可是一个月后  才是她生日啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Whoa, whoa. But her birthday's not for another month.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.86,0:02:39.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是  没错  但在生日当天开派对  那就不惊喜啦\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, but if we throw her a party on her birthday, then it's not a surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.95,0:02:41.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得这主意不错\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I think that's a great idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.12,0:02:44.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们办个晚宴派对  邀请好朋友过来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We can have a dinner party and invite her close friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.74,0:02:46.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗斯  我们要帮瑞秋办惊喜派对喽\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ross. We're having a surprise party for Rachel.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.25,0:02:49.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  搞定\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay. Done.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.54,0:02:55.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  那你要一起办吗  乐意之至\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, great. So do you wanna do it together? I would love to do it together.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.97,0:03:01.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她们要一起来啦\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}They're gonna do it together.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.34,0:03:03.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,兄弟  那位可是我女友\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Dude, that's my girlfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.76,0:03:05.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以我就得闭嘴\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So I gotta shut it down now?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.97,0:03:09.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  我得走了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right, I gotta take off. 
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.69,0:03:12.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要接班  然后去参加大试镜\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm picking up Ben and then we're off to the big audition.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.81,0:03:15.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看到有演员假装是班的父亲  那种感觉一定很怪\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's gonna be weird to watch some actor pretending to be Ben's dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.07,0:03:18.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  能怪过看到班的两个妈妈温存吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah. Weirder than his two moms making out?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.45,0:03:23.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,爸爸  广告里面有爸爸\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Whoa, whoa. Dad? There's a dad in the commercial?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.49,0:03:26.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  班和爸爸喝汤  演得很陶醉的样子\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah. The dad and Ben eat soup and pretend to enjoy it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.99,0:03:29.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或许我可以跟你们一起去  搞不好能试镜演那个爸爸\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, maybe I'll go with you and see if I can audition as the dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.04,0:03:32.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,说到扮演班的爸爸  由我这教父上场最适合了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I mean, who better to play Ben's father than his godfather?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.62,0:03:35.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你不是班的教父  什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You're not his godfather. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.55,0:03:37.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你在开玩笑吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Are you kidding?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.05,0:03:41.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当然是啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Of course I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.09,0:03:46.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们走吧  教父  好啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, let's go, godfather. All right. Ha, ha.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.31,0:03:55.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  我通过了  他们让我试镜\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, I'm in. They're gonna let me audition.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.61,0:03:57.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真的  太棒了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Really? That's great.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.27,0:04:02.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道  有个女的看过我演的舞台剧  所以我离她离得远远的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I know, I know. One of the casting ladies has actually seen me in a play. So I steered clear of her.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.45,0:04:05.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那个孩子看起来很眼熟\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That kid looks familiar.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.70,0:04:08.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  他拍过一堆广告\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, he's done tons of commercials.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.29,0:04:10.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有糖果广告  新力游戏机\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I've seen him in Sugar Smacks, PlayStation...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.70,0:04:12.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还帮电话公司拍过广告\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...and that one for the phone company.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.41,0:04:16.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他演得实在是太好了  我索性跟着换了电话公司\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}In fact, he was so good in that one. He actually convinced me to switch phone companies.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.00,0:04:19.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,钱德因此还气得半死\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Chandler was mad.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.17,0:04:23.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不过  他这次休想拿到这角色  因为班比他可爱多了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, well, he's not gonna get this one. All right? Ben is way cuter than that kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.93,0:04:26.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看就知道  宝贝  看看你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I mean, look at him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.31,0:04:36.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很好  不过若我能演班的爸爸  这样是不是很棒\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's great. Listen, wouldn't it be great if I got to play Ben's dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.44,0:04:37.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乔伊  你跟班一点都不像\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Joey, you look nothing like Ben.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.44,0:04:41.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,比你跟他像多了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I look more like him than you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.95,0:04:47.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我跟你还不熟  哪里生得出小孩\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, I really don't know you well enough for you to do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.25,0:04:54.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在是最后的二选一\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So it's down to these two.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.54,0:04:57.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,南西  我知道你喜欢这一个  我也有同感\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Nancy, I know you like this one and I think I agree.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.96,0:04:59.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瑞秋  你觉得呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Rachel, what do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.25,0:05:01.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那个是很漂亮\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, um, that one is pretty...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.55,0:05:05.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但我更喜欢这个的质感  抱歉了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...but I just love this fabric. Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.68,0:05:08.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不用抱歉  你的职责之一就是多出好点子\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, don't be sorry. That's part of your job here, to give your opinions.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.47,0:05:10.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,功劳归我  开玩笑的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And then I take credit for them. I'm kidding. Ha, ha.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.02,0:05:15.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她这次是在开玩笑  下次别再跟她有不同意见了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}She is kidding. But don't ever disagree with her again.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.27,0:05:17.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这次换我在开玩笑\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, now I'm kidding. Oh, ha, ha.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.60,0:05:19.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真是有趣的办公室\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, what a fun office.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.94,0:05:24.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道要选哪一个  不过先来根烟倒是真的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I don't know which one. But I do know I need a cigarette.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.44,0:05:28.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不如我们出去休息一下  等回来之后再解决\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So, what do you say we take a break, go outside and figure this out when we come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.49,0:05:32.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瑞秋  嗯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Rachel?  Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.87,0:05:33.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你抽烟吗  不抽\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You smoke? No.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.04,0:05:37.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我爸是医生  老跟我说些恐怖的故事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}My dad's a doctor. And he would always tell me just horror stories...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.84,0:05:44.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,说那些鬼神精灵的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}About ghosts and goblins...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.46,0:05:49.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,完全赞同公主抽烟的权利\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...who totally supported the princess' right to smoke.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.27,0:05:59.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她们在抽烟的时候  就背着我做出了决定\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And then they came back from smoking and they'd made all of the decisions without me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.48,0:06:01.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这样不太公平  我知道啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That doesn't seem fair. I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.31,0:06:04.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不同流合污还被处罚  抽烟可是恶心又伤身的习惯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's like I'm being punished for not having this disgusting, poisonous habit.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.15,0:06:06.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对  抽烟最棒了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, it is the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.57,0:06:10.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,万一  这种事没完没了怎么办\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I mean, what if this keeps happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.32,0:06:12.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她们在外头抽烟做决定\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Y'know, they'll-they'll be outside smoking, making all the decisions...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.87,0:06:17.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我只能在办公室里  呼吸愚蠢的新鲜空气\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...and I'll just be up in my office breathing in my stupid clean air.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.41,0:06:21.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,到时候等阿金要升我们的职  你们想她会选谁\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know? And then when the day comes when Kim wants to promote one of us,who do you think she's gonna pick?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.33,0:06:23.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,  是我还是乌烟瘴气的冒烟女\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Me or Smokey Smokerson?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.38,0:06:28.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瑞秋  你也可以一起去  不用抽烟  就说要去透透气\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Rachel, you can go down there, you don't have to smoke.Just say you wanna get some fresh air.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.34,0:06:32.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对  这我做得到\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, I could do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.22,0:06:34.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,简单一点的就是  一起抽烟\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, or you could just do the easy thing and smoke.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.06,0:06:38.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  瑞秋  要去喝咖啡吗  嘿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey. Rachel，Do you wanna go get coffee? Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.60,0:06:40.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乐意之至  好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, I would love to. Oh, good.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.65,0:06:42.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,宝贝  我也想起去  好啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm gonna go too, babe. Oh, good.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.44,0:06:47.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等等  我变卦了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, I changed my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.36,0:06:53.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  来讨论派对的事  我有一大堆点子\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, let's talk about the party. I have so many ideas.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.33,0:06:55.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我也是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ooh, me too. Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.33,0:06:58.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,耶  真是壮观啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah! Oh, look at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.87,0:07:02.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  这是蛋糕的素描图\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right. This is a little sketch of the cake. Uh-huh. Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.79,0:07:05.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还有一些菜单的样本\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}See? Um, some sample menus.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.50,0:07:08.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不如用异国小点心当餐前菜\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Um, you know, I thought we'd start with a Tuscan-style finger food.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.63,0:07:12.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,至于音乐嘛  这是我收藏的CD的字母列表\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay. And for music, here's an alphabetized list of all of my CDs.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.09,0:07:16.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,跟食物超级搭配的还都做了记号\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I've highlighted the ones that'll go really good with the food.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.77,0:07:19.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不是说要亲密的晚餐派对吗  现在不那样做了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What happened to the intimate dinner party? Oh, we're not doing that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.77,0:07:22.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  那么  好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay? So... Wow. All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.44,0:07:26.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看来你全包办了  多谢"共同"主办人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Looks like you took care of everything. Thanks a lot, cohost.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.65,0:07:30.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了  我没有一手包办啊  你要做的事还有很多\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wait. I didn't take care of everything.there's-there's plenty of things for you to do!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.36,0:07:32.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,举个例子\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Uh-huh? Like what?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.11,0:07:34.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,杯子\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Cups.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.62,0:07:37.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,杯子  你让我准备杯子\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Cups. You're giving me cups?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.95,0:07:39.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还有冰块\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And ice.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.33,0:07:43.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,杯子和冰块  我可以负责杯子和冰块\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Cups and ice? Oh, I get to be in charge of cups and ice?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.58,0:07:45.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.92,0:07:49.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,行  我就负责杯子和冰块\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Fine. Okay, I will be in charge of cups and ice.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.17,0:07:50.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等等  冰块可以从餐厅拿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wait, I can get ice at the restaurant...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.80,0:07:52.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,冰块是我的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I got it! Mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.34,0:07:55.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨  嘿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hi. Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.72,0:07:59.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,试镜顺利吗  不太顺利\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}How did the audition go? Not so good.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.56,0:08:02.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,慢着  你在学乔伊那招吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wait a minute. Are you doing Joey's:
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.89,0:08:05.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,“试镜不太顺利" \N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}"The audition didn't go so well."
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.40,0:08:06.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,事实上  很顺利对吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, it did!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.69,0:08:09.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没错\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, I am!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.45,0:08:15.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,班取得了第二次试镜的资格  太好了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, Ben got a second audition. Oh, great.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.28,0:08:20.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对  是我让罗斯那样沮丧的  因为我没有过关\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, I had to teach Ross my bit because I actually didn't get a callback.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.91,0:08:23.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你也过关了  对吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You got a callback too, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.17,0:08:27.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没错\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, I did!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.42,0:08:34.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瑞秋  你怎么会来这里\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, Rachel. What are you doing out here?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.01,0:08:42.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,里头有点无聊  我就想来这里透透新鲜空气\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know, it got kind of lonely up there, so I just thought I would come out here and get some fresh air.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.18,0:08:45.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,南西和我正好讨论到秋装  太好了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We were talking about the fall collection. Oh, great.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.27,0:08:46.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以  这是要\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So anyway, we really...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.06,0:08:49.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉  瞧你被我们熏的  没关系\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm sorry. We're smoking all over you. That's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.15,0:08:51.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  不  你待着  我们走\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, no, no. We'll move. You stay there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.69,0:08:55.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,总之我把设计寄给罗夫  他很喜欢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I sent the designs to Ralph. He was excited about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.57,0:08:58.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太好了  你是最棒的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's great. You are the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.53,0:09:01.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不好意思  能借支烟吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Excuse me. Can I bum one of those?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.83,0:09:04.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这个就好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Y'know what, actually this one's...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.92,0:09:08.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们在聊什么好笑的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, okay, okay. What's so funny over here?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.75,0:09:10.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我还以为你不抽烟的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I thought you didn't smoke.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.00,0:09:15.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我以为你们是说抽大麻烟\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know, I thought you guys meant marijuana cigarettes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.26,0:09:18.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,知道我的意思吗  像瘾君子那样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know what I mean? Like, doobies?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.01,0:09:24.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,事实上  我还纳闷儿  "你们是疯了不成"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Actually, I thought to myself, "Those guys are crazy."
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.39,0:09:26.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有啦  其实  普通香烟我一直爱抽\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But no, actually, I smoke the regular ones all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.90,0:09:28.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们会抽大麻\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We get high.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.61,0:09:33.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我也是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.69,0:09:36.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我说笑的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm kidding. Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.99,0:09:38.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我也是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.41,0:09:44.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,老天  这真是折磨人  你是怎么习惯的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, God. This is so nerve-racking. How do you do this?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.12,0:09:48.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我过关的经验不多  所以\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, fortunately, I don't get many callbacks so...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.04,0:09:51.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们在试镜之后被留下来  这是好现象吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Is it a good sign that they asked us to hang around after the audition?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.88,0:09:53.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天知道\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Who knows?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.26,0:10:01.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,最后入围的是雷蒙  班  凯尔和乔伊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay. We have narrowed it down to Raymond, Ben, Kyle and Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.39,0:10:02.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,其余的人辛苦了  谢谢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}The rest of you, thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.14,0:10:05.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好呀  我就知道\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yes! I knew it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.81,0:10:08.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,再见\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ah. Bye-bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.35,0:10:11.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,再会\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So long.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.15,0:10:13.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,后会有期\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Later.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.28,0:10:17.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太棒了  我有可能饰演班的爸爸\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}This is great. I might actually get to play Ben's dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.74,0:10:20.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,其实  那是不可能的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Actually, that can't happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.41,0:10:22.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为你们各自的长相都不同\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Because you all have such different looks...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.58,0:10:25.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以我们把你和雷蒙配对  凯尔和班是一组\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...we're putting you with Raymond and Kyle with Ben.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.79,0:10:28.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以最后只有一组会出线\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So it'll either be you two or you two.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.92,0:10:31.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要命\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.75,0:10:35.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这样就有点尴尬了  真的是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}This is gonna be kind of weird. Yeah, it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.01,0:10:38.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对  一定会很尴尬\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah. It's gonna be weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.51,0:10:44.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为我们是最好的朋友  所以才会尴尬\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No. We're like best friends. That's why it's weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.81,0:10:48.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,原来如此  我只是搭腔而已\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I thought we were just talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.15,0:10:56.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  嘿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey. Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.40,0:10:59.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我能把这些东西放这里  等着给瑞秋过生日吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Is it okay if I leave this stuff here till Rachel's birthday party?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.99,0:11:03.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当然可以  里头是什么  杯子\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Uh, sure. What's in them? Um, cups.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.78,0:11:07.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那好  因为我们替瑞秋  准备了八百加仑的水\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, good, because we got Rachel 800 gallons of water.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.00,0:11:10.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,老实说  这些杯子还真不少\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Seriously, that's a lot of cups.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.37,0:11:12.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对  这是因为我负责杯子和冰块\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, well, that's 'cause in charge of cups and ice,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.79,0:11:16.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,摩妮卡在这一天将后悔莫及  因为她要我负责杯子和冰块\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And Monica's gonna rue the day that she put me in charge of cups and ice.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.13,0:11:21.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我也后悔过一次  除了后悔没做别的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know, I rued the day once. Didn't get a whole lot else done.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.18,0:11:26.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  该把其他杯子搬上来了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, time to bring up the rest of the cups.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.18,0:11:30.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  乔伊  嘿  菲比\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, Joey. Hey, Pheebs.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.89,0:11:33.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  罗斯  你在这里正好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey. Ross, good, I'm glad you're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.02,0:11:37.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我有事要跟你说  怎么了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I want to talk to you about something. Oh. What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.61,0:11:40.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我一直在想这次拍广告的事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, I've been thinking about this whole commercial thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.15,0:11:44.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我和班硬碰硬  捉对厮杀\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know me against Ben. The two of us competing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.91,0:11:47.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这样比怎么都不会有好结果  所以\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, that can't lead to anything good. So, 
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.45,0:11:52.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想我还是退出好了  告诉他们我不去试镜\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I think I'm just gonna step aside. I'm gonna tell them that I won't audition.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.38,0:11:58.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乔伊  太好了  多谢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wow. Uh...Joey, that's great. Thanks, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.22,0:12:04.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就这样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.89,0:12:09.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你真的要让我这样做  这事关我的职业生涯啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You're gonna let me do this? This is my career we're talking about here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.68,0:12:13.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可是你说  我是要你说出让班退出\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But you just I just said that so you wouldn't let Ben do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.69,0:12:16.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗斯  如果真有人要退出  那也应该是班\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Look, Ross, if anyone should step aside, it should be Ben.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.98,0:12:18.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么  钱德  告诉他为什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What? Chandler, tell him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.65,0:12:24.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我先去开门\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, let me get the door first.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.95,0:12:27.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有人  你好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, hi, no one.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.16,0:12:32.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么班应该退出\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Why should Ben step aside?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.08,0:12:35.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这原本就是他的试镜\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It was his audition in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.29,0:12:39.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是跟过去的  就像是跟班老爹\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You just tagged along. You're like the tag-along dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.46,0:12:41.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,起码我有顾虑到班的感受\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}At least I care about his feelings.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.34,0:12:42.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.88,0:12:45.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道万一他没通过试镜  到时他会有多难过吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Do you know how hard this is gonna be on him when he doesn't get it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.18,0:12:48.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那他又为什么不会通过\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And why wouldn't he get it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.30,0:12:53.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,得了吧  你有没有看过  跟我同组的小子有多厉害\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, come on.Have you seen what my kid can do? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.10,0:12:56.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他会拨电话  吃墨西哥脆片\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I mean, he dials phones, he eats tortilla chips.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.81,0:13:00.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还会凭空踢足球演对手戏呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}He plays soccer with the cartoon tiger.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.57,0:13:04.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是说你的那个小子能喝汤  比我儿子厉害\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Are you saying your kid eats soup better than my kid?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.45,0:13:07.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你只是给他一根汤匙罢了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You just give him a spoon, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.41,0:13:09.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是吗  我们走着瞧  好啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, yeah? I guess we'll see. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.91,0:13:11.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这支广告片的主角  非我和米契莫属\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Because this commercial belongs to me and Mitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.16,0:13:15.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你的孩子叫做雷蒙  对  你的也是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Your kid's name is Raymond. Yeah? So is yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.42,0:13:20.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,（中央咖啡厅）
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.92,0:13:23.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有没有用  很棒\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}How did work go? Oh, it was great. It was great.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.38,0:13:24.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我听你们的建议  去她们抽烟的地方\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I went down there just like you said.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.13,0:13:28.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们讨论到了生意  阿金完全接受我的意见\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And we talked business. And Kim totally took my opinions.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.68,0:13:29.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你浑身烟味\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You stink.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.85,0:13:34.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,多谢  我是说真的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Thanks. No, I'm serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.35,0:13:36.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为那里的人全都在抽烟\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's because I went down there and they were smoking.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.89,0:13:39.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这其实是成功的味道\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}This is actually the smell of success.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.40,0:13:44.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不过有点怪怪的  天啊  你有抽烟\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But there's something different, though.Oh, my God. You smoked.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.78,0:13:47.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我没有  才怪\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I did not. Yes, you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.61,0:13:50.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你看起来像又生病又快乐  你一定有抽烟\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You look happy and sick. You smoked.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.03,0:13:54.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好啦  我是有抽  为了事业不得已嘛\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right, fine. But I had to. I had to do it for my career.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.00,0:13:57.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真希望我也可以  为了事业这么做\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I wish I had to smoke for my career.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.62,0:14:00.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这样很恶心啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's so gross.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.59,0:14:02.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没那么糟吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, no, it's not that bad, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.84,0:14:07.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,虽然舌头有点打结  手指也有点怪味\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I mean, yeah, my tongue feels a little fuzzy and my fingers sort of smell.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.88,0:14:10.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,其实我感觉快吐了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I actually feel like I could throw up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.22,0:14:15.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  但你一定要撑过这一关  再来就会是快乐无比了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But you gotta push past this, okay? Because it's about to get so good.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.56,0:14:18.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,钱德\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Chandler.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.98,0:14:21.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我给你说  你浑身的烟味  我得出去透透气了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I have to tell you, you smell so smoky, I have to get up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.32,0:14:23.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我没骗你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm not kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.32,0:14:26.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得你闻起来很香\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I think you smell great.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.70,0:14:34.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以大家都同意了  不要格子图案  要粉红\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So we're decided. No on plaid, yes on pink.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.58,0:14:36.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,完全正确\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Absolutely.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.25,0:14:38.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我举双手双脚赞成\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm so onboard.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.08,0:14:42.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瑞秋   这支烟不是才刚点吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Rachel, didn't you just light that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.50,0:14:48.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  但是你知道吗  我正在努力少抽烟\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah. But you know what? I'm just really, really trying to cut back, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.59,0:14:50.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瑞秋  我等着看笑话\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Good luck, Rach.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.35,0:14:54.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,其实我最近有想要戒烟\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I've actually been thinking about quitting.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.35,0:14:56.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我每周日晚上  都告诉自己要戒烟\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, well, sure. Every Sunday night, I tell myself I'm quitting.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.02,0:14:59.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,结果周一还不是狂抽猛抽\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Every Monday morning, it's like:
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.35,0:15:00.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还用你说\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Tell me about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.69,0:15:03.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那就戒了吧  我们一起戒烟\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, let's quit. We'll just quit. Let's all quit.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.82,0:15:04.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听起来是很诱人啦\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It does sound appealing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.11,0:15:07.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我戒烟从没成功过  你可以的  一定行\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I never could do it. But you could. You can. Absolutely.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.03,0:15:09.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们可以互相帮忙\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We can help each other out.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.20,0:15:13.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,用那个什么戒烟贴布的  我们能组成戒烟三姊妹\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We could get those patches. We could be like the Patch Sisters.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.83,0:15:16.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,其实我们真的应该戒烟  好吧  一起来戒烟\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know, we really should quit. Okay, let's quit.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.83,0:15:21.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  太棒了  把香烟给我  来  通通交出来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yes. Great. Give me those cigs. Come on. Give it. Give it. Out. Done. Quit. Whoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.42,0:15:27.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那个打火机是我前夫送我的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}My late husband gave me that lighter.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.97,0:15:30.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我没在开玩笑\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm not kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.09,0:15:32.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那好吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, then. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.18,0:15:37.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,汤\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Mm, soup.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.43,0:15:40.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,汤\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Mm, soup.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.81,0:15:44.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,汤\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Mm, soup.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.06,0:15:46.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乔伊  罗斯随时会到\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Joey, Ross is gonna be here any second.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.77,0:15:49.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我去上个厕所  帮我看一下班  好吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}would you mind watching Ben for me while I use the ladies' room?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.32,0:15:50.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好啊  没问题  谢谢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, no problem. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.29,0:16:02.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨  班\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hi, Ben.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.62,0:16:04.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你想当演员啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So you want to be an actor, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.08,0:16:07.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,告诉你  演戏可不像野餐\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, I gotta tell you, it's no picnic.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.63,0:16:09.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有碰不完的钉子\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}There's tons of rejection.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.34,0:16:10.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一点都不稳定\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No stability.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.13,0:16:14.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,前一天  你还是德瑞克医生\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I mean, one day, you're Dr. Drake Ramoray.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.34,0:16:18.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,隔天  你就要去啃蕃茄酱\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}The next day, you're eating ketchup right out of the bottle.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.35,0:16:22.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乔伊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.56,0:16:24.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗斯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ross.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.11,0:16:28.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,班\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ben.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.03,0:16:31.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,班  班\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I mean, Ben. Ben.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.78,0:16:33.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,雷蒙   乔伊  该你们上场了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, Raymond, Joey, you're up.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.12,0:16:39.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨  好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hi. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.12,0:16:43.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  我们来试一次  你们准备好了就开始\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right, well, let's try one. Whenever you guys are ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.92,0:16:46.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有问题吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Uh-oh. Is there a problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.13,0:16:50.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是面汤  我练习时是用蕃茄汤\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, this is noodle soup. And I've been working with tomato.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.55,0:16:54.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不过还好了  没关系  没关系\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But that's okay. No problem. No problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.43,0:16:56.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,面汤\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Mm, noodle soup.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.18,0:16:59.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你那样不错  不过台词是 "汤"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know, that's fine. But the line is, "Mm, soup."
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.72,0:17:02.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那我刚才说什么  面汤\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh. What'd I say? Mm, noodle soup.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.02,0:17:06.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有什么不一样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}How's that different?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.15,0:17:11.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh. Right. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.61,0:17:15.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  我们来试一次\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right. Let's try one.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.78,0:17:21.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,面汤\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Mm, noodle soup.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.83,0:17:28.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  我们再来次  好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay. Let's do it again. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.71,0:17:35.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,汤  我是说  是"面汤"  不对  "汤"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Mm, soup.I mean, noodle soup. I mean, soup.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.84,0:17:36.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你争气点\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.68,0:17:41.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们得换下一组了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know what? We need to move on.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.18,0:17:45.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  我再演一次  你看\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, no, I could do it one more time.See, look.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.60,0:17:47.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,面汤\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Mm, noodle soup.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.10,0:17:49.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可恶\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.24,0:18:00.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  嘿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey. Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.03,0:18:02.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,被逮到了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Uh-oh. Busted.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.91,0:18:08.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们这是在干嘛  我们不是戒烟姊妹花吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Come on, you guys. What are you doing? I thought we were the Patch Sisters.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.42,0:18:10.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对  可是那样行不通\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, that didn't work out.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.21,0:18:14.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瑞秋  我们想尝试着戒烟  但实在是太难了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Rachel, we tried to quit. But it was too hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.67,0:18:18.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们开始抽烟  起码也该告诉我一声嘛\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, y'know, if you started smoking again, you could have at least told me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.22,0:18:20.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,拜托  快给我来支  刚才说到哪里\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Come on, give me one of those. What are we talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.05,0:18:22.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不行  你戒烟很成功  不许放弃\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, you're doing great. Don't give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.72,0:18:25.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以我们才没跟你说  我们不想拖你下水\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's why we didn't tell you, and we are not gonna drag you down with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.81,0:18:28.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等等  别这样  拖我下水\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, wait. No, no. Drag me down. Drag me down.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.23,0:18:31.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瑞秋  千万不行  你戒烟成功  我们都替你骄傲\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Forget it, Rachel. We're both so proud of how well you're doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.19,0:18:32.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不能让你前功尽弃\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm not gonna let you blow it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.82,0:18:34.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,若被我查到你有带烟  我一定炒你鱿鱼\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}In fact, if I catch you, you're fired.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.65,0:18:38.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,走吧  离开这里  走啊  我不要你吸二手烟  走啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So go on, get out of here. Go on. I don't want you breathing this stuff. Go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.74,0:18:41.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那好  你和我一起去法国出差\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So okay. So you'll come with me on the Paris trip?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.62,0:18:43.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要命\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.21,0:18:51.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你瞧瞧  杯子帽  杯子布条\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, check it out. Cup hat, cup banner...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.92,0:18:55.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,杯子吊灯  还有本尊  杯子\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...cup chandelier and the thing that started it all. The cup.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.92,0:18:59.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,菲比  你对杯子还真有一套\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Great job with the cups, Pheebs. Ha, ha.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.22,0:19:02.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你干脆跟她去约会算了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Why don't you just go out with her?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.39,0:19:06.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你有没有注意到冰\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Did you notice the ice? Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.27,0:19:10.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,各式各样的都有  有碎冰  冰块还有干冰  注意看\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We have it all. We have crushed, cubed and dry. Watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.44,0:19:15.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很有神秘感吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Mystical.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.90,0:19:23.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没人想吃我的小点心  他们全跑去吃菲比的雪花冰\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Everyone--no one's eating my Tuscan finger food 'cause they're all filling up on Phoebe's snow cones!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.66,0:19:25.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有雪花冰\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}There are snow cones?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.41,0:19:27.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,雪花冰  最恶心了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Snow cones. Yuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.66,0:19:29.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你去吃啦  谢谢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Y'know…go! Go! Right there!  Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.13,0:19:36.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,注意  惊喜\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Look, look. Surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.46,0:19:40.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么啊  一个月后才是我生日啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What? My birthday is not for another month.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.30,0:19:42.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这样才有惊喜啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's the surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.76,0:19:46.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天啊  你们太棒了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, my God, you guys. This is so great.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.81,0:19:51.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我完全没想到  钱德的生日还比我早到呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's so unexpected.I mean, Chandler's birthday's even before mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.90,0:19:56.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,惊喜\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.15,0:20:03.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真是太棒了  看看这些\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wow. This is so great. Look at all these...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.61,0:20:06.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,杯子  真的是怪怪的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...cups. This is so weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.20,0:20:09.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,杯子是我负责的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I was in charge of cups.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.25,0:20:11.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  那就没那么怪了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, okay. Not so weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.63,0:20:16.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  嘿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey. Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.63,0:20:20.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我很遗憾  你试镜不顺利\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Listen, man. I'm sorry the audition didn't go well.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.09,0:20:22.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是喔\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.72,0:20:25.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  乔伊  我是真的很遗憾\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, really. I am, Joey. I feel bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.64,0:20:29.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗斯  你用不着遗憾\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, look, Ross. You don't have to, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.35,0:20:31.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是我自己太差  怨不得你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's not your fault I suck.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.23,0:20:35.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,连〝面汤"都说不好  还算哪门子的演员\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What kind of an actor can't even say, "Mm, noodle soup"?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.36,0:20:44.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道吗  或许你搞砸了试镜  不是因为你差\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, you know what? Maybe you didn't mess up your audition because you suck.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.53,0:20:49.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或许你演砸了试镜  是因为你更在意你的"教子"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Maybe you messed up because you care more about your godson.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.20,0:20:53.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么意思  我认为  在潜意识里\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What do you mean? I think, subconsciously...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.71,0:20:55.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等等  我听不懂\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Whoa, you lost me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.67,0:21:01.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是觉得在某种程度上\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I think, on some level,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.05,0:21:05.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你故意演砸了自己的试镜\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}you sabotaged your own audition
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.34,0:21:07.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是为了让班拿到那个角色\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}so Ben would get the part.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.72,0:21:13.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你的说法让我感觉舒服多了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, your way sounds a lot better than mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.89,0:21:15.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.94,0:21:18.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对啊  不是我演技烂  不是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah. It's not that I'm a bad actor. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.48,0:21:22.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只是我  太关心小班的成长了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, it's just that, uh, I care so damn much about little Ben...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.74,0:21:26.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看到他成功  对我来说更重要\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...that, uh, it was more important for me to see him succeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.28,0:21:28.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就是这样  谢谢你  谢谢你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}There you go. Thank you. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.03,0:21:30.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那他拿到角色没  没有\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So did he get it? No.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.08,0:21:32.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那确实没办法了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ah, what are you gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.96,0:21:42.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不好意思  瑞秋葛林在吗  我跟她约了吃中饭\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, hi. Excuse me. Is Rachel Green here? I'm supposed to meet her for lunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.42,0:21:45.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她现在不会来这里了  请到10楼找她\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, she doesn't come down anymore. You can find her up on 10.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.59,0:21:47.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, great.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.84,0:21:53.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们昨天中饭聊到提案报告  他担心一个人出差不够看\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So we talked about the  whole presentation yesterday at lunch and he wondered if one person would be enough  to get a take on the trip
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.39,0:21:55.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我说 "绝对没问题"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And I said, "Yeah, absolutely."
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.98,0:22:02.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,后会有期了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'll catch you guys later.
